        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Doll Squad, Seduce and Destroy\n- Companies: Feature-Faire\n- People: Ted V. Mikels, Francine York, Michael Ansara, John Carter, Anthony Eisley, Leigh Christian, Tura Satana\n- Topics: film release titles, cast, film production roles\n\nFacts:\n- The Doll Squad is a 1973 low-budget action Z movie by Feature-Faire.\n- The Doll Squad was later re-released under the title Seduce and Destroy.\n- Ted V. Mikels directed, edited, co-wrote, and co-produced The Doll Squad.\n- The Doll Squad features Francine York, Michael Ansara, John Carter, Anthony Eisley, Leigh Christian, and Tura Satana.\n- Francine York, born Francine Yerich on August 26, 1936, was an American film and television actress.\n- Francine York died on January 6, 2017.",
